22 15.42 11.57 15.65C10.93 15.88 10.23 16 9.5 16ZM9.5 14C10.75 14 11.81 13.56 12.69 12.69C13.56 11.81 14 10.75 14 9.5C14 8.25 13.56 7.19 12.69 6.31C11.81 5.44 10.75 5 9.5 5C8.25 5 7.19 5.44 6.31 6.31C5.44 7.19 5 8.25 5 9.5C5 10.75 5.44 11.81 6.31 12.69C7.19 13.56 8.25 14 9.5 14Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></button></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div class="faqs__inner" data-v-b67004cf><section class="faqs__wrapper" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__content" data-v-b67004cf><div class="faqs__inner-slices" data-v-b67004cf><div data-v-b67004cf><!--[--><section id="what&#39;s-a-parcelshop?" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h1><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What&#39;s a ParcelShop?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h1><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A ParcelShop is just our name for fast, friendly and handy parcel services at your nearest corner shop, newsagents or supermarket. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->There are 9,000+ ParcelShops throughout the UK, and they come in all shapes and sizes. But every ParcelShop has one thing in common: longer opening hours and quicker service.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->These simple facts make Evri ParcelShops much more flexible than many traditional postal services. Many ParcelShops are open seven days a week, from early ‘til late. In fact, 80% of ParcelShops open until 10pm. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops give you more convenience to send, collect and return parcels, no matter how hectic your day is. <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find your 