 collecting your Evri parcels even easier.","whats-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fwhats-a-parcelshop",{"id":334,"type":335,"tags":336,"lang":337,"slug":145,"first_publication_date":338,"last_publication_date":338,"uid":145,"link_type":339,"key":340,"isBroken":341},"Yhj0kBIAACgA3Cfn","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:24:03+0000","Document","11d6cf49-231a-49f2-a52f-5f5e098b9bd4",false,{"id":343,"type":344,"tags":345,"lang":337,"slug":145,"first_publication_date":347,"last_publication_date":348,"uid":145,"link_type":339,"key":349,"isBroken":341},"YitraREAAC4AQybq","faq-category",[346],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:31:57+0000","2022-05-12T12:56:04+0000","81facfab-fd07-4c3b-8e8c-d26a307e8841",[351],{"variation":352,"version":353,"items":354,"primary":356,"id":392,"slice_type":393,"slice_label":394},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[355],{},{"content":357},[358,366,370,373,376,389],{"type":359,"text":171,"spans":360,"direction":365},"heading1",[361],{"start":362,"end":363,"type":364},0,20,"strong","ltr",{"type":367,"text":368,"spans":369,"direction":365},"paragraph","A ParcelShop is just our name for fast, friendly and handy parcel services at your nearest corner shop, newsagents or supermarket. ",[],{"type":367,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":365},"There are 9,000+ ParcelShops throughout the UK, and they come in all shapes and sizes. But every ParcelShop has one thing in common: longer opening hours and quicker service.",[],{"type":367,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":365},"These simple facts make Evri ParcelShops much more flexible than many traditional postal services. Many ParcelShops are open seven days a week, from early ‘til late. In fact, 80% of ParcelShops open until 10pm. ",[],{"type":367,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":365},"ParcelShops give you more convenience to send, collect and return parcels, no matter how hectic your day is. Find your nearest ParcelShop.",[379,387],{"start":380,"end":381,"type":382,"data":